02},{"w":"flight...","s":326.41,"e":327.16,"line":102},{"w":"Still","s":327.16,"e":327.59,"line":103},{"w":"reaching","s":327.59,"e":328.28,"line":103},{"w":"for","s":328.28,"e":328.53,"line":103},{"w":"the","s":328.53,"e":328.79,"line":103},{"w":"light","s":328.79,"e":329.22,"line":103}],"lines":[{"s":1.2,"e":3.63,"text":"First memory, Bush on the screen,"},{"s":3.63,"e":6.87,"text":"Talking New World Order, what could it mean?"},{"s":6.87,"e":10.4,"text":"One of my first words was \"checkbook,\" they say,"},{"s":10.4,"e":14.08,"text":"I was asking big questions from my very first day."},{"s":14.08,"e":16.65,"text":"I learned to cook when I was young,"},{"s":16.65,"e":19.82,"text":"Loved electricity and how things were done."},{"s":19.82,"e":22.39,"text":"Copper wire wrapped around a screw,"},{"s":22.39,"e":25.41,"text":"Add a battery, watch what magnets can do."},{"s":25.41,"e":28.13,"text":"Years at Rutgers, partying all night,"},{"s":28.13,"e":31.74,"text":"Then I found a laboratory, studying things right."},{"s":31.74,"e":34.61,"text":"Working with ultrasound, testing pills,"},{"s":34.61,"e":37.7,"text":"Measuring tiny spaces hidden inside still."},{"s":37.7,"e":41.3,"text":"We sent sound through tablets, measured the time,"},{"s":41.3,"e":44.54,"text":"Two kinds of waves helped the numbers align."},{"s":44.54,"e":47.48,"text":"Four hundred volts made the system fire,"},{"s":47.48,"e":51.46,"text":"I was back to electricity, just like that copper wire."},{"s":51.46,"e":54.1,"text":"Iron washers, testing something new,"},{"s":54.1,"e":57.93,"text":"Then strange things happened I couldn't see through."},{"s":57.93,"e":61.46,"text":"Equipment stopped working, then came back again,"},{"s":61.46,"e":64.55,"text":"A computer resumed like it never had been."},{"s":64.55,"e":67.64,"text":"A bolt moved toward a screwdriver one day,"},{"s":67.64,"e":70.66,"text":"I got so scared, didn't know what to say."},{"s":70.66,"e":73.75,"text":"Was it just magnetism? Something I missed?"},{"s":73.75,"e":76.69,"text":"I wanted the answers, not another twist."},{"s":76.69,"e":80.08,"text":"I spent my life chasing things I couldn't see,"},{"s":80.08,"e":83.24,"text":"Trying to understand what they meant to me."},{"s":83.24,"e":85.82,"text":"Every time I thought I knew it all,"},{"s":85.82,"e":88.69,"text":"Another question made the heavens call."},{"s":88.69,"e":91.04,"text":"ABOVE THE GRAYS! ABOVE THE GODS!"},{"s":91.04,"e":94.28,"text":"In the world I dream, I'm beating every odd!"},{"s":94.28,"e":97.52,"text":"Higher than Olympus, farther than the stars,"},{"s":97.52,"e":100.9,"text":"I'll keep on rising, no matter where they are!"},{"s":100.9,"e":103.18,"text":"TIME OF FLIGHT! INTO THE LIGHT!"},{"s":103.18,"e":106.93,"text":"Sending all my questions through the endless night!"},{"s":106.93,"e":110.17,"text":"I don't need a throne, I don't need a crown,"},{"s":110.17,"e":113.7,"text":"I'm building myself up, they can't keep me down!"},{"s":113.7,"e":116.79,"text":"Then I started seeing patterns everywhere,"},{"s":116.79,"e":120.4,"text":"License plates and strangers, signals in the air."},{"s":120.4,"e":123.86,"text":"People's actions seemed connected to my dreams,"},{"s":123.86,"e":127.39,"text":"I feared they read my thoughts, or so it seemed."},{"s":127.39,"e":129.82,"text":"Went to the police, then the FBI,"},{"s":129.82,"e":132.98,"text":"Asked for some answers, needed to know why."},{"s":132.98,"e":136.22,"text":"Went for mental health care, then rehab too,"},{"s":136.22,"e":139.97,"text":"Looking for the truth and a way to make it through."},{"s":139.97,"e":143.14,"text":"Every day brought moments that felt divine,"},{"s":143.14,"e":146.23,"text":"Miracles and mysteries filling up my mind."},{"s":146.23,"e":150.27,"text":"Didn't know what they meant, didn't know what was real,"},{"s":150.27,"e":153.88,"text":"But I knew how powerful those moments could feel."},{"s":153.88,"e":157.7,"text":"Troll lords and mobsters became villains in my tale,"},{"s":157.7,"e":160.94,"text":"A battle in my head where I refused to fail."},{"s":160.94,"e":164.47,"text":"Found comfort in Jesus, but questioned his name,"},{"s":164.47,"e":168.23,"text":"Had some peace and anger burning in the same flame."},{"s":168.23,"e":171.69,"text":"Then I played a god with a wild sense of pride,"},{"s":171.69,"e":175.36,"text":"Said, \"Christ copied me!\" with a theatrical smile."},{"s":175.36,"e":178.75,"text":"Two thousand years apart, an impossible claim,"},{"s":178.75,"e":182.43,"text":"But I turned my strange story into music and fame."},{"s":182.43,"e":184.78,"text":"ABOVE THE GRAYS! ABOVE THE GODS!"},{"s":184.78,"e":188.02,"text":"In the world I dream, I'm beating every odd!"},{"s":188.02,"e":191.26,"text":"Higher than Olympus, farther than the stars,"},{"s":191.26,"e":194.64,"text":"I'll keep on rising, no matter where they are!"},{"s":194.64,"e":196.92,"text":"TIME OF FLIGHT! INTO THE LIGHT!"},{"s":196.92,"e":200.68,"text":"Sending all my questions through the endless night!"},{"s":200.68,"e":203.91,"text":"I don't need a throne, I don't need a crown,"},{"s":203.91,"e":207.44,"text":"I'm building myself up, they can't keep me down!"},{"s":207.44,"e":210.83,"text":"Now I'm coding all day, making websites shine,"},{"s":210.83,"e":214.07,"text":"Building new inventions, one idea at a time."},{"s":214.07,"e":217.3,"text":"Freestyling faster, trying to break my best,"},{"s":217.3,"e":220.84,"text":"Working on my body, putting muscles to the test."},{"s":220.84,"e":223.85,"text":"Zeus has lightning? I studied that spark!"},{"s":223.85,"e":226.94,"text":"Apollo has music? I can light up the dark!"},{"s":226.94,"e":229.89,"text":"Hermes has speed? Watch these words fly!"},{"s":229.89,"e":232.98,"text":"Even the Greek gods can watch me aim high!"},{"s":232.98,"e":236.66,"text":"Gray aliens in spaceships, kings of distant skies,"},{"s":236.66,"e":240.56,"text":"In my science-fiction story, I can match their minds."},{"s":240.56,"e":244.46,"text":"I can write a universe where I'm the greatest of all,"},{"s":244.46,"e":248.5,"text":"But in real life I'm human, still learning when I fall."},{"s":248.5,"e":251.59,"text":"Call myself a sex god, say it with a grin,"},{"s":251.59,"e":255.12,"text":"I'm my own competition, every day I want to win."},{"s":255.12,"e":258.36,"text":"Faster with the rhymes, stronger every year,"},{"s":258.36,"e":262.41,"text":"Building something beautiful while facing down my fear."},{"s":262.41,"e":266.09,"text":"After all the strange events and mysteries untold,"},{"s":266.09,"e":269.91,"text":"After all the dreams of power, all the stories bold,"},{"s":269.91,"e":272.93,"text":"I found myself at a Hindu temple one day,"},{"s":272.93,"e":276.24,"text":"With a thousand questions I couldn't explain."},{"s":276.24,"e":279.55,"text":"I came down from Olympus, had to face defeat,"},{"s":279.55,"e":283.6,"text":"Because after all that god talk, I still needed to eat."},{"s":283.6,"e":285.95,"text":"ABOVE THE GRAYS! ABOVE THE GODS!"},{"s":285.95,"e":288.6,"text":"My imagination goes beyond the odds!"},{"s":288.6,"e":292.36,"text":"Past a million galaxies, beyond the highest throne,"},{"s":292.36,"e":295.89,"text":"Every world I dream begins with what I've known!"},{"s":295.89,"e":298.17,"text":"TIME OF FLIGHT! INTO THE LIGHT!"},{"s":298.17,"e":301.77,"text":"I'm chasing understanding with everything inside!"},{"s":301.77,"e":305.9,"text":"Not a god above creation, just a man who dreams so high,"},{"s":305.9,"e":309.79,"text":"I can build a thousand worlds beneath an endless sky!"},{"s":309.79,"e":311.41,"text":"First word, checkbook."},{"s":311.41,"e":313.03,"text":"First magnet, a screw."},{"s":313.03,"e":314.87,"text":"Four hundred volts later,"},{"s":314.87,"e":317.23,"text":"Still searching for what's true."},{"s":317.23,"e":319.21,"text":"I challenged gods in music,"},{"s":319.21,"e":321.13,"text":"Made the stars feel small."},{"s":321.13,"e":323.48,"text":"But learning how to live my life"},{"s":323.48,"e":325.91,"text":"Might be the greatest win of all."},{"s":325.91,"e":327.16,"text":"Time of flight..."},{"s":327.16,"e":329.22,"text":"Still reaching for the light"}],"duration":329.72,"source":"estimated","generatedAt":null}